<title>GERMANY: Asiana to launch Seoul-Frankfurt flights end May.</title>
<headline>Asiana to launch Seoul-Frankfurt flights end May.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean carrier Asiana Airlines will launch twice-weekly Seoul to Frankfurt services at the end of May, Flughafen Frankfurt Main AG (FAG) said.</p>
<p>Asiana said last November it planned to use Boeing 747 combi aircraft on the route as a way round restrictions on launching freighter flights to Europe.</p>
<p>Cargo sales in Germany for the airline are handled by general sales agent Aerotrans Luftfahrtagentur GmbH.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax 5017</p>
</text>
